2. Kg2 Bc3 3. g5 ( { Possibly } 3. Rb7 $1 { was more technical, securing the b-pawn while keeping the rook on the seventh rank; e.g. } g6 4. Rb6 Kg7 5. h4 $1 Rc7 6. Kg3 { keeping a slight edge - Ivanchuk. } ) 
