 ( { The game continued with } 7. Kg3 Kg6 8. Kf4 Rc6 9. e4 f6 10. Kg4 fxg5 $6 { Another dubious capture, which leaves Black's kingside broken and yields White more space in which to operate. More sound was } ( 10. Kg3 Bb2 11. Nh4 Kf7 12. f4 { with just a slight edge for White - Ivanchuk. } ) 
